{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And every firstling</b> — two times in the Masorah; this one and the other is וכל פטר חמור. As stated in Bekhorot: a cow that gave birth to something like a donkey, and a donkey that gave birth to something like a horse, are exempt from the firstling, as it says: פטר חמור פטר שגר — four times, until both the one giving birth and the one born are a donkey."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:42.214728720Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}